course: dictionary
lesson: 1000
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and context tells you which one is meant. The word bola can mean a throwing weapon, or it can be the name of a spider. «The bolas spider makes no web: it swings a single line with a sticky blob.» The clues are spider, web and moths, so this bola is an animal, not a weapon.
explain: Ask yourself: what word would fit here? Then try your meaning in the sentence. If you put "weapon" into the spider sentence, it does not make sense, so the meaning must be the spider.
explain: In history lessons, a bola is a throwing weapon made of two or three heavy balls joined by cords. It was thrown to wrap around an animal's legs and catch it. Gauchos, the cowboys of Argentina, and native peoples of South America used bolas for hunting. The clues are hunting, throw and cowboys.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: A word can have more than one meaning, so check the clues to find the right one.
fact: A bola is a throwing weapon of heavy balls joined by cords.
fact: Bolas spider is the name of a spider that catches moths with a sticky ball on a thread.
fact: Bolas is the plural of bola: one bola, two or more bolas.
exercise: «The bolas spider makes no web: it swings a single line with a sticky blob.» What does the bolas spider catch? | Fish | Birds | Flies | *Moths
exercise: In history lessons, what is a bola? | A sticky web | A wide, flat hat | A gaucho's horse | *A throwing weapon of heavy balls joined by cords
exercise: Which word means more than one bola? | bola | bolo | *bolas | bolos
test: In «The bolas spider makes no web», what kind of word is bolas? | *The name of a spider | A weapon | A kind of hat | A cloud
test: Which clue shows a bola is a weapon, not a spider? | The word web | The word moths | The word sticky | *The words hunting and throw
exam: Ella reads: «Throw a bola and the animal's legs are tangled.» Which meaning fits best? | A gaucho's hat | *A throwing weapon made of heavy balls joined by cords | A kind of sticky blob | A spider that makes no web
